	}
	if entry.Epoch == next.Epoch {
		enrForkID.NextForkEpoch = params.BeaconConfig().FarFutureEpoch
	}
	// ...
}
```
When entry.Epoch == next.Epoch (no upcoming fork), NextForkEpoch is set to FarFutureEpoch, which is the correct "no-fork" invariant per spec.

